Subject: [PATCH 5/6] test(post): recorded streams carry the work offset as an
 index (#931)

Main's recorded-stream guards (b471395e) build Dump { wcs: "G54" };
Dump::wcs is the 1-based index since this slice, so they build
wcs: 1. The byte-for-byte stream guards then require the streams to
read PARAM WorkOffset 1.000000, regenerated with WRITE_GOLDEN=1 on
recorded_streams and recorded_post_streams. Every posted golden is
unchanged: offset 1 still posts each dialect's first-offset word.

Refs #931

